window.products.push({"id":973094,"name":"Soccer Ball Car Coasters for drinks - Set of 2 | Perfect Car Accessories with absorbent coasters. Car Coaster measures 2.56 inches with rubber backing","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51d10uab+eL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"No one likes a sweaty, dirty cup holder. You know, the ones that have caked on coffee stains, sticky soda residue, or moldy stuck on straw wrappers or paper. No, no, no! Help prevent this nonsense with our non stick, non slip rubber coasters for drinks. Our vibrant rubber coasters protect it from moisture and scratches and universally fit most, if not all, drop in cup holder. So are you ready to protect your investment and ball up your cup holder?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51d10uab+eL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IT'S A SKIN","source_asin":"B085KL9LML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-973094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085KL9LML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085KL9LML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":973095,"name":"KIMGREENY Wine Glass Holder Wine Holder for Shower Bath Tub Accessories Beer Shower Caddy wtin Scrub Towel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HCmMU4xyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Name : KIMGREENY Wine Cupholder & Exfoliating Washcloth(3pcs) Size : **Cupholder : 2.8inchX3.5inchX4inch(7.2cmX9cmX10.2cm) **Exfoliating Washcloth : 5.5inchX5.9inch(14cmX15cm) Use : Multipurpose cup holder for Wall -Can be applied to slightly rough surfaces Using the 'high-function special adhesive'. Installation 1. Make the surface clean and dry before installation. Dust, oil, and moisture reduce adhesion. 2. Without the Solution Pad, you can attach it to any smooth surface like tile, marble, mirror, glass...etc. 3. The Solution Pad allows you to attach it on more diverse surfaces; matt, textured tile, marble, mirror, plastic, glass, steel, Aluminum, powder-coated surface, slightly bumpy, uneven, or scratched surface **If you do not need the Solution Pad, just keep it for later. It can be used when you want to move the cup holder to another place or to reinstall the cupholder. Perfect Gift Option for Wine Lover and Beer Lover -We put lots of energy and effort into choosing the right adhesive because we wanted our customers can utilize this product as various surface types as possible. -If you have no idea what type of wall the gift recipient has this can be the best option. Refund& Return Policy It sticks well to most surfaces, but there are only a few exceptions. Although the surface looks smooth, when it is coated with *low surface energy material(Polyvinyl Acetate, PE, PP, Tedlar (PVF), EVA...etc.), the adhesion will decrease. However, such cases are rare. Since it is difficult for us to figure out the material of the attached surface of our customer, we can get a 100% refund or return in case of poor adhesion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HCmMU4xyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KIMGREENY","source_asin":"B08NWS11RC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-973095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NWS11RC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NWS11RC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
