window.products.push({"id":973100,"name":"Kids Alarm Clock, LED Digital Alarm Clock with Time-Date-Alarm, Snooze, 7 Colours Night Light Bedroom Alarm Clock for Toddlers, Boys and Girls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IpjPSo98L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⏰ Never let your kids be late again! -Waking up early is a pain for most people, and this is also true for kids. So, in response to the screams, moans and worries of kids who don't want to get out of bed, we've developed a digital alarm clock for kids with a night light to wake them up with a gentle chime and get them through the morning ⏰ Keeps kids out of the dark - when they are scared or need to get up, the kids' alarm clock produces a soft light in seven different colours to create a different atmosphere in the bedroom or home. If you want to check the time or find something at night, you can tap the top of the clock and it will emit a soft light for 5 seconds and then turn off automatically. Let the bedroom alarm clock night light accompany your child to escape the darkness ⏰ This alarm clock is powered by 3 AAA batteries and displays a 7-color night light, alarm, date, temperature and time. Simple and cute design, so you can take it with you in the bedroom, kitchen, office or on the go, very convenient, even as a gift for kids and friends ⏰Features multifunctional LED display - LEDs for time (12 and 24 hour time format), day of the week, date, temperature (°F or °C), children's alarm clock Press \"SET\" to activate the children's alarm clock and press up/down to set the hours - minutes - year - month - day - week sequence for children ⏰ SAFE MATERIALS - The alarm clock case is made of high quality ABS material which is highly rigid and tough and 100% non-toxic. Parents can rest assured that their kids will be able to use our alarm clocks.ABS material is not easily damaged or worn and is really safe for your kids","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IpjPSo98L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Medxin","source_asin":"B0B3CR7G38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-973100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3CR7G38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3CR7G38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
