window.products.push({"id":973310,"name":"B-Lock Suction Hooks Towel Holder Towel Hooks Super Hooks Lock Tool ABS + TPU Material Super Strong Suction Base Without Tool Location is Removable an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VBZW8JheL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INSTRUCTIONS No tools. No Track. No Damage.For glass, polished tiles, stainless steel, lacquer finish surface only How to fix suction cup 1. Select desired smooth, no-porous, flat surface area avoiding any grout line. Clean area where fixture will be at.2. Remove protection film in the back of the suction cup.3. Set up the B-Lock on desired area. Apply firm pressure on center of cap and press down the bar.4. Make sure suction cup is sticking well to the surface.5. Your B-Lock is ready to use. Care and Maintenance 1. Wipe with soft, damp cloth. Do not use abrasive or chemical cleaners.2. The B-Lock should be removed, cleaned and refitted if there are any indications of movement, slippage, or if the product has suffered an impact or knocks. Warnings and Cautions 1. Check that your B-Lock is securely fixed to the mounting surface before use.2. Do not use your B-Lock as a grab bar or security rail.3. Do not overload your B-Lock and ensure that any load is evenly distributed.4. Do not use your B-Lock on porous surface may cause leakage, such as marble, wall paper, painted wall, nature wood….","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VBZW8JheL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Block","source_asin":"B01MZ6Q3T4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-973310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MZ6Q3T4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MZ6Q3T4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
