window.products.push({"id":973345,"name":"DII Gingham Check Table Top Collection 100% Cotton, Machine Washable Use for Everyday Family Dinners, Special Occasions, Holidays, Spring and Summer P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZbKXfcNlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DII 20x20\" napkins are perfect for large gatherings, weather it is a family dinner, a graduation party, baby shower, a birthday and more. Whatever event you are hosting these napkins are a great option. These napkins are of high quality construction, oversized and look great. Care instructions: machine wash cold separately, gentle cycle, wash before first use, tumble dry low, low iron. In order to maintain the qualities necessary in cotton napkin, nothing has been added to the cotton. Because of this, the all-natural fibers will shrink upon the first washing. In order to minimize the shrinkage, after washing do not dry the napkins on high heat and do not dry fully. Medium heat is best and remove just prior to being completely dry. .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZbKXfcNlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DII","source_asin":"B01D668MMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-973345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01D668MMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01D668MMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":973346,"name":"Ulbek Multifunctional Rectangular Tissue Box Cover, Nordic Style Storage Box with Remote Control Holder, 8.3” X6.3” X4.7” Tissue Holder for Home Resta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JaszKVs2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐NOTE: Multipurpose tissue box cover: 8.3” X6.3” X4.7”(LxWxH). The tissue holder can store about 180 sheets of 2-layer removable tissue and fits 8.3” X3.1” X4.7” Inside size tissue packs, larger size packs should remove the original bag and manually fill the tissue box into this tissue box. ⭐Multifunctional Use: The multifunctional tissue box can store many items, such as school supplies, glasses, office supplies, mobile phones, TV remote control, etc. From now on, you can say goodbye to your messy desktop! The simple look is very clean and fresh. I believe that when you see a neat desktop, your mood will definitely improve! ⭐Wide Mouth Design: The mouth design of this tissue box is very wide. Whether it is a large paper towel, small paper towel, or roll paper, the paper towel can be removed very smoothly. There are non-slip foot pads at the bottom to effectively prevent the tissue box from slipping! (Free four cute stickers, You can DIY your tissue box yourself! ) ⭐High Quality: This rectangular tissue box holder is made of PP material. Strong and durable, easy to clean, smooth edges and corners, safer to use, the material is waterproof, so don't worry about not being able to use it in the bathroom. ⭐Wide Range of Uses: Versatile and practical, high quality and low price, it will not collide with other people's gifts. A great choice for Birthday/Valentine's Day/Mother's Day/Christmas/Thanksgiving/Housewarming/Promotion. Make smart use of space and keep your desk tidy! You can put the tissue box on your dresser, desk, desk, bathroom, bedroom, or living room!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JaszKVs2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ulbek","source_asin":"B0B9BDFKTF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-973346","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9BDFKTF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9BDFKTF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
