window.products.push({"id":973420,"name":"Wanapure 25 Pack Acrylic Diamond Table Number Holder, Crystal-Clear Place Card Holders, Tabletop Cardholder Menu Picture Photo Reserved Card Stand for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r7CQ2F03L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique Design & Heavy Base – Clear acrylic diamond shaped design, and the table card holder has a wide, solid and sturdy base (per weight: 0.032ib/14.5g), so it can stand and steady well even in outdoor conditions, you don’t have to worry about your table number falling over and ruining your table display. Elegant & Creative Table Number Clip – Made of high-clarity acrylic materials, and with beautifully diamond shaped, they can catch and reflect the light, even outdoors in the sunshine or indoor lighting and candlelight, to create a lovely display. Your guests will be impressed with your party supplies. Fit for Different Sizes Cards – Measuring 1.5” diameter x 0.9” height (3.81cm x 2.29cm) for the holder, 0.08” width x 0.39” depth for the slot (0.2cm x 1cm), and the large slot can hold different sizes or thickness cards, such as 5x7” place cards, 4x6” table numbers, recipe, mini menu, notes, name cards, photos, pictures, postcards, business card, dish name and so on. The table numbers or number cards can be place quickly as they slide into the slot on the top of the diamond simply. Perfect Gift & Individually Wrapped - What makes us different from others is that each of our holders has an independent package so you can store it for your next use. Also they are not taking up too much room on your tables. And don’t throw them away after your weddings, parties and events as you and your guests or friends can take them home as souvenirs to use as a memo and photo holder, this may give your guests a good memory for your party. Multifunctional Place Card Holder – This great 20 pack clear diamond table number holder will add style and elegance as wedding decorations for reception tables, party table and bridal shower ornaments. It can also be used as a support for displaying menus, names or table numbers in buffets, anniversary celebrations, family gatherings, restaurants, banquet, café, hotels, baby shower parties, birthday parties, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r7CQ2F03L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wanapure","source_asin":"B07Y9HT9B7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-973420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y9HT9B7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y9HT9B7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
