window.products.push({"id":973884,"name":"Cremation Urn for Adult Ashes - Hand Engraved urn for Human Ashes in a Gold Design - Large Metal Hand Finished Burial and Funeral Cremation Urn - Memo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819sN2LGBqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Liliane Memorials Brass Cremation Urns Corinthian Urn in Bronze Finish Funeral urn is handcrafted of 100% brass and finished in bronze.  This delicate hand-engraved motif includes a simple and classic Grecian design.  Time-honored design offers an elegant resting place for your loved one.  Attractive urn will fit well with any decor, particularly on a mantel over a fireplace or in a library.  The Corinthian Urn evokes the memory of your loved one in a traditional and timeless design. About Liliane's Memorial Urns Our handcrafting process results in slight variations in color or finish, making each urn a unique work of art. Our urns offer a threaded lid that allows you to safely and securely handle or transport the urn. A felt-lined bottom is standard on all of our urns to protect your fine furniture. Liliane's urns are maintenance free; simply wipe the hand-made brass urn with a clean dry cloth. All of our urns are wrapped in an plush cotton bag and securely packed in a box. This urn has a capacity of 190 cubic inches, and will fit the remains of most adults weighing up to 190 lbs. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee We trust that you will be happy with the quality and design of our products If you are not happy with the design you selected, please return your unused urn to Amazon for a full credit and select another Liliane Memorial Urn. Unfortunately, given the personal nature of funeral urns we cannot accept returns after you have used the urn.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819sN2LGBqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Liliane Memorials","source_asin":"B01IWRDI3S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-973884","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IWRDI3S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IWRDI3S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":973885,"name":"Haton Window Privacy Film Frosted Bamboo Self Static Window Cling Covering Sticker Glass Film Non-Adhesive Removable Decorative Window Decal Anti UV S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dbrnq8D1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bamboo Pattern, Unique Decoration - This window film features the classic frosted texture, the 3D bamboo pattern is very pleasing to the eye and provides the privacy you are looking for. Say goodbye to expensive curtains or blinds, and decorate your house perfectly with minimal cost. It’s ideal for rental room or for temporary privacy requirements Effectively Block Harmful UV Rays - This frosted window film can block 84% of UVA rays and 99% of UVB rays , protects your skin and furniture from getting directly exposed to sunlight. Slow down fading of flooring , furniture etc. So you can enjoy staying in a comfortable room filled with softened natural light No Glue Hassle & Easy to install - Our 3D bamboo window privacy film is static cling, free of glue design, no chemical release, needn't use any adhesives. Make sure the glass surface is completely clean and smooth, wet the window glass and film with soapy water, you can easily paste the window films on your window. Remember to peel off the film backing Removable & Reusable- This bamboo window film constructed out of a premium vinyl material has a long useful life, easy to position and remove, no residue. So it can be reused if not damaged or smudged. This product is only suitable for clean, smooth and no smudge glass surface, do not use on rough, uneven, frosted glass or other materials Protected Privacy, Secured Life - The semi-private window film serves a functional purpose in adding partial privacy for your personal space by preventing people outside from seeing directly into the room and obscuring outdoor views. Widely suitable for different places: kitchen, living room, dining room, office, hotels, classroom, lobby, etc.Protection Level is 60%, not recommended for bathroom","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91dbrnq8D1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Haton","source_asin":"B08R61YMTD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-973885","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R61YMTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R61YMTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
