window.products.push({"id":973887,"name":"MOLI & BUNNY 24 oz Stainless Steel Water Bottle For Kids and Adults. Wide Mouth Vacuum Insulated Water Bottle For Sports and Travel. BPA Free Modern L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rO1oGJebL._AC_.jpg","description":"Vacuum Insulation: Our advanced design stainless steel vacuum insulated water bottle which keep drinks cold for 24 hours or smoking hot for 12 hours with our innovative wide mouth insulated water bottle. Using state-of-the-art methods, our insulated water bottle maintains the liquid temperature inside the bottle for hours and prevents condensation from forming on the exterior. Enjoy your beverage anytime, anywhere, and help reduce the use of plastics in our environment. Durable : Featuring three amazing colors to choose from - red, black and cool blue. Take your durable metal water bottle on any adventure wherever, whenever! Our wide mouth water bottles are essential and indispensable companions whether you're hiking in the great outdoors or riding a bike in the city or countryside - our insulated water bottle will keep you hydrated 24/7. Perfect Size: Our insulated water bottles are available in 24oz size. Convenient and carry anywhere, this is the perfect size water bottle to bring with you whether you are jogging, running, walking or riding a bike. Perfect size for kids and adults alike. The wide mouth feature allows for easy refilling, drinking and cleaning. MOLI & BUNNY provides you with absolutely safe water bottles to help you drink healthy water every day. Proper Maintenance: To keep your insulated water bottle in tip top condition, always wash well with neutral detergent before use. Add a small amount of lukewarm water when washing and wipe clean and dry the inside portion when not using it for a long time. Do not use alkaline bleach, chemical detergent, metal wire ball for cleaning. Do not put any salty liquid to prevent corrosion. Never Paint Shedding: Double walled design stainless steel vacuum insulation and powder coated bottle body make sure it never sweat and 100% nontoxic and safe, durable finishing make the paint won’t shedding, can use it for years. The exterior features of the product provide extra grip to the cup, making it easy to carry any outdoor activity with you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rO1oGJebL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOLI & BUNNY","source_asin":"B0BPSQLKM3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-973887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPSQLKM3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPSQLKM3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":973888,"name":"Oven Add-A-shelf, Freestanding Oven Rack, Made of Durable Stainless Steel, Chrome-Plated, Kitchen Appliances, Safe Up To 446 Degrees – Measures 13 1/2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51os-3oyPBL._AC_SL1168_.jpg","description":"This freestanding oven rack adds an instant shelf to your oven, allowing you to cook an extra dish while still leaving room to warm plates. Utilizing otherwise wasted space at the bottom of an oven, it's a great way to \"cook smarter\" and save energy and time, whether tossing in an extra batch of cookies, browning rolls or baking a side dish along with a big roast. The chromeplated stainless steel Oven AddAShelf sits at the base of the oven to add an extra shelf, and can store right in the oven when not in use. Oven shelf measures 13 1/2\" L x 15\" W x 1 3/4\" H; fits ovens over 15\"W and is safe up to 446F (avoid direct contact with oven element or flame). When you don't need an extra oven shelf, this ingenious design also works on the countertop, doubling as a handy cooling rack.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51os-3oyPBL._AC_SL1168_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Miles Kimball","source_asin":"B07B4ZG4YK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-973888","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B4ZG4YK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B4ZG4YK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
