window.products.push({"id":973903,"name":"Evaporative Air Cooler, 45\" Tower Fans that Blow Cold Air Cooling Fan with 90° Oscillating, Touch and Remote Control, 3 Mode / 3 Speeds, 5L Water Tank","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610ShYXNyXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️【3-in-1 Evaporative Cooling Fan 】 3-in-1 portable tower cooling fan that blows air, humidifies air, and cools the air to produce large cool humid air volume for your dry, hot rooms.erful Meets Portable: Dreo's all-in-one airflow system combines with a supercharged electric motor, delivering high-speed, brisk cool. This 36-inch compact tower fan enlivens every inch of air in your living space fast at up to 24ft/s. ❄️【Efficient Cooling Effect 】 Tower fan with professional optimized air duct, 3 modes and 3 wind speeds which is increased to 6.3m/s and the air volume can reach 430m³/h. 1-sided rigid high-density cooling pads for increased evaporative surface area generating cooler air. ❄️【Flexible Airflow】 90° Oscillating Fans have 115 cm high-position extended air outlet design and wide-area air supply allow you to direct the airflow to where you need it. ❄️【Quiet Standing Fan Even at Night】 Crossflow impeller wheel design smooths out fan noise to deliver ultra quiet cooling, the operating noise is as low as 35dB, leaving your sleep or work in the room always undisturbed during hot summer days and nights. ❄️【5L Water Tank】The 5L water tank can run continuously for 6-10 hours outputting cool air,keeping your hot, dry air cool and moist overnight. (runing time is dependent on ambient humidity).The removable water tank, cooling pad, and rear grille make regular cleaning and maintenance a breeze. ❄️【Air-conditioning Partner】 Wide-area air supply function, when used with air conditioners, it can promotes air circulation, quickly balances the room temperature of the whole house, and feels more comfortable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610ShYXNyXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZICOOLER","source_asin":"B0B87MHQ51","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-973903","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B87MHQ51","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B87MHQ51","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":973904,"name":"Air Purifiers for Home Large Room Up to 1345 Ft², Tailulu H13 True HEPA Air Filter Purify Smoke Pollen Pet Dander Dust Smell for Bedroom, Kitchen, Off","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":76.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-q5TXJeEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[More Air, Less Time] Enjoy clean, fresh air – fast! Equipped with powerful brushless motor for efficient air cleaning performance and energy saving, Tailulu air purifiers for bedroom filter spaces up to 1345 ft²in 1 hour, 224ft² in 10 minutes. Save over 30% on energy bills. 360° air duct design, reducing air loss by 34% and increasing air intake by 48% with full coverage. [Advanced 3 Stages Filtration]The air purifiers for home use 3-stage filtration system, including a pre-filter, true H13 HEPA filter and activated carbon filter, which purify 99.97% of 0.3-micron particles from dust, pollen, PM 2.5, pet dander, smoke, cooking smell, hair, keeping a fresh and healthy state in your bedroom, nursery, kitchen, bathroom or office. [Sleep Quiet, Wake Refreshed]Breathe freely and sleep better as the air filter design with sleep mode and optional blue night light to create you a quiet and soothing sleeping environment. Adopt silent filtering technology, the hepa air purifier runs at 29dB quieter than a whisper. Let you forget it’s there while sleeping or working. Soft night light puts your mind at ease and make you sleep deeper. Customize the timer of the room purifier（2/4/8H), wake up with fresh air everyday! [User-Friendly]Press the child lock button to lock the touch panel, avoiding error operation by your curious kids or pets. The filter indicator light will turn on when it’s time for replacement. We recommend replacing the filter every 3-6 months to ensure optimum performance of the pet air purifier. (Please search: B0BFX15HBS for Replacement Filter) [3 Wind Modes]The air cleaner for home offers 3 wind modes to meet your needs: High, low and sleep mode. Free to adjust it as your requirement. The dust air purifier is ozone-free with FCC, ETL, CARB certified- Compliance with California's strictest safety standards. You can count on our reliable quality to improve indoor air quality, guarding the health of your whole family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-q5TXJeEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tailulu","source_asin":"B0BWTDX3HL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-973904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWTDX3HL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWTDX3HL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
