window.products.push({"id":973992,"name":"BAMFOX 6 Tier Shoe Rack,Bamboo Stackable Shoe Storage Organizer Unit Entryway Shelf in Natural Color,3 Pack 2-Tier","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ghE3HplIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BAMFOX Shoe Rack The stylish and decorative shoe rack with two-tier from BAMFOX has flexibility and stability which can be used as well to put on shoes. The measurement of the shoe rack is 27.2 x38.4x10.9inch and is a space-saving alternative to shoe cupboards. The rack provides enough space for shoes and it can be used indoor as well as outdoor on the balcony. Please avoid intensive solar radiation and prevent it from rain. Features -SPACE SAVING SHOE ORGANIZER-  This home-complete Shoe Rack keeps your shoes organized. This elegant and modern shoe rack features a compact design that keeps your home organized and stylish. High-quality storage rack for shoes, bags, plants, toiletries, baskets, etc. -BAMBOO FRAME & EASY ASSEMBLY- The shoe rack is made of 100% Natural bamboo material, maximizes stability.Bamboo panels are harder and denser than wood and have higher compressive and bending strength. Detailed instructions are included and setup takes only minutes. -100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE- BAMFOX offers premium products for your home while exceeding highest industry standards and offering impeccable customer care. Any problem during normal usage, or any dissatisfaction with the shoe rack, Contact us, replacement or Refund both accepted. Our goal is to make you completely satisfied with this purchase. Specifications Brand:BAMFOX Item Net Weight:2.95lbs Material: natural bamboo  Color:natural Product Dimensions :27.2 x38.4 x10.9inch ⚠ Caution: Please do not put the shelf flat upside down, which may cause problems with the load-bearing of the metal sheet joint. (The side with the metal piece should be placed face down) Our shoe rack can withstand 20kg items and is guaranteed not to be bent. It has been tested by the factory, so please feel free to use it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ghE3HplIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAMFOX","source_asin":"B083PZQ5TL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-973992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083PZQ5TL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083PZQ5TL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":973993,"name":"Yaheetech 2pcs Storage Cabinet Kitchen Buffet Cabinet with Sliding Doors and Adjustable Shelf, Stackable Cupboard for Kitchen Living Room Dining Room ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":165.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616Xj0g3pNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Out-of-sight storage】Want knick-knacks away from sight? With our classic sideboard, you can keep it a clean look in your living room/kitchen/bedroom. With its durable shelf board, you can make full use of the door-enclosed space inside the cabinet. With the open area on top, you can make varying decorations with your favorite flower pots, antiques, candle holders, handicrafts, and more to accent the entire room in many different ways. 【Easy-to-slide doors】Our sliding storage cabinet is built with 2 doors running on smooth plastic roller wheels. Unlike the pull-and-push hinge door pattern, this sliding style does well in space saving and thus is great for small rooms. Also, it provides you with easy access to the stored items. In spite of missing door handles, you can take advantage of the door face carvings for convenient handling as well as simple decoration. 【Adjustable shelf】Inside this buffet cabinet is a height-adjustable storage shelf. With such a shelf, you can manage to make the top storage space high within a range from 8.7\" to 12.6\". The adjustment fittings come along in the package for your convenience. Following the instruction manual, you'll find it easy to adjust the shelf to your variable needs. 【Versatile applications】This multipurpose home cupboard is suitable for both large and small space. Whether it is for the sofa side or against the wall in your living room, kitchen or bedroom, it can be a good piece of budget-friendly home storage furniture. 【Easy assembly】We have an easy-to-read assembly instruction manual attached to each package of this wall cabinet. You can get an equivalent digital manual as well via the QR code there. In addition, our customer service team will assist you with your inquiries about the installation and stuff, we prepare a clearer assembly video for easy installation. Kindly note that besides our backups you might still want to have more hands with the assembly for work efficiency.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616Xj0g3pNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yaheetech","source_asin":"B089NGBBY8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-973993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089NGBBY8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089NGBBY8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
